# Dev tooling under tools/: the scripts themselves are TRACKED (subsetting,
# e2e pass scripts, perf baseline). Only the heavy/derived assets stay
# ignored. The old blanket /tools/ also ignored the tracked scripts —
# `git add tools/<new-script>` silently no-op'd and new tooling went
# untracked without anyone noticing.
#  - tools/mpv/: FetchBundledLibmpvTask's fetched binaries (libmpv ~115 MB,
#    lua51) + the appResources packaging copies it mirrors there.
#  - tools/font/*.ttf: original (pre-subset) font inputs dropped beside
#    subset_subfont.py — multi-MB, re-obtainable (sha256 in its README).
#  - tools/e2e state dirs: Jellyfin docker volumes, books-probe fixture
#    state (per-run images, databases, logs).
tools/mpv/
tools/font/*.ttf
tools/e2e/.state/
tools/e2e/books-probe/.state*/